  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Playbook**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the initial framework for a digital learning playbook, particularly for robotics students. The visual style is taking shape \342\200\223 I envision a playful, doodle-pop aesthetic with line drawings on a white canvas. Currently, I\'m mapping out the user interface, including an interactive dashboard for project navigation. Chapter 1, the introductory module, has also started.\n\n\n**Structuring the Modules**\n\nI\'ve been structuring the robotics playbook modules to encompass key principles. My focus is now on incorporating parts used, component purposes, and wiring diagrams. I\'m also planning to integrate mathematical formulas, code, and project instructions, aiming for a structured learning path with independent exercises. I\'m excited about this structure. Also, I\'ve updated the `metadata.json` to reflect the project\'s new name and description. Now, I\'m working on the layout, thinking white backgrounds, black borders, and vibrant shadows.\n\n\n**Defining the \'Blink\' Module**\n\nI\'ve just fleshed out Chapter 1, \"Blink an LED\", the introductory module for the robotics playbook. I\'ve broken down the key concepts: electricity basics, necessary parts, component purposes, and even wiring diagrams (thinking ASCII art for now). I\'ve integrated Ohm\'s Law and resistor calculations, with Arduino C++ code and example projects. I\'ve also added three distinct exercises for users to expand upon the concepts. I\'m now setting up the file structure and updating `metadata.json`.\n\n\n**Refining the Aesthetic**\n\nI\'m now diving into the visual design, aiming for that line-doodle illustration style. I\'m exploring playful Tailwind styling and thinking about comic-style fonts. I\'ve decided to use a custom font, `Shantell Sans`, from Google Fonts to give that doodle feel. I\'ve updated my CSS and HTML to incorporate it. I\'m also planning the core components now, with a `Sidebar.tsx` for navigation and a `Dashboard.tsx` for the main dashboard interface.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 206679857
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
