  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-white text-black font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-b-4 border-black flex items-center justify-between px-8 bg-[#FFD700]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 border-4 border-black rounded-lg bg-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl rotate-3\\\">R</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"font-black text-2xl tracking-tight\\\">ROBO-PLAYBOOK <span class=\\\"text-sm font-bold bg-black text-white px-2 py-0.5 ml-2 rounded-full uppercase\\\">Beginner v1.0</span></h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"h-4 w-48 bg-white border-2 border-black rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"h-full w-[12%] bg-[#6BCB77] border-r-2 border-black\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"font-black text-sm uppercase\\\">12% Mastered</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 border-4 border-black rounded-full bg-white flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-black rounded-sm\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-64 border-r-4 border-black bg-[#F8F9FA] p-6 flex flex-col gap-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase text-gray-500 mb-2\\\">Project Roadmap</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-4 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"font-black text-lg\\\">01</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">The Bionic Blink</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-gray-300 flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60 grayscale\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"font-black text-lg\\\">02</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Servo Sweeper</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-gray-300 flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60 grayscale\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"font-black text-lg\\\">03</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Sonar Lookout</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-gray-300 flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60 grayscale\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"font-black text-lg\\\">04</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Remote Rover</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-gray-300 flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60 grayscale\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"font-black text-lg\\\">05</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">AI Navigator</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 border-4 border-dashed border-black rounded-xl bg-[#4D96FF]/10 text-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-1\\\">Tip of the Day</div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Red wires usually mean power (+), black mean ground (-)!</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 p-8 grid grid-cols-2 grid-rows-2 gap-6 bg-[#FAFAFA]\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-1 row-span-1 bg-white border-4 border-black rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(255,107,107,1)]\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black mb-4 uppercase flex items-center gap-2 underline decoration-[#FF6B6B]\\\">01. Essentials</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"border-2 border-black p-3 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 mb-2 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center bg-[#FFD700] rounded-full\\\">\360\237\222\241</div>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-sm uppercase\\\">LED</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-center opacity-70\\\">Emits light when current flows one way</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"border-2 border-black p-3 rounded-lg flex flex-col items-center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 mb-2 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center bg-[#4D96FF] rounded-lg\\\">\342\232\231\357\270\217</div>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold text-sm uppercase\\\">Resistor</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-center opacity-70\\\">Chokes current to save your components</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-100 border-2 border-black rounded-lg\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-1 text-[#FF6B6B]\\\">The Science Bit</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"text-lg font-mono font-bold\\\">V = I \303\227 R</div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium\\\">Voltage (V) equals Current (I) times Resistance (R).</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-1 row-span-1 bg-white border-4 border-black rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(77,150,255,1)]\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black mb-4 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\\\">Wiring Diagram</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative h-full w-full border-2 border-black bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-48 h-24 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center bg-[#6BCB77]/20 relative\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"absolute -top-3 left-10 px-2 bg-white border-2 border-black text-[10px] font-bold\\\">MICROCONTROLLER</div>\\n             <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"w-8 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-red-500 rounded-sm\\\"></div>\\n                <div class=\\\"w-8 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-black rounded-sm\\\"></div>\\n             </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute h-0.5 w-16 bg-red-500 top-1/2 left-[60%] border-t border-black\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute top-[40%] right-10 w-12 h-12 border-4 border-black rounded-full bg-yellow-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">LED</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-1 row-span-1 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white border-4 border-black rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xl font-black uppercase text-[#6BCB77]\\\">Upload Logic</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] px-2 py-1 bg-white/10 rounded border border-white/20\\\">Blink.ino</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <pre class=\\\"text-sm font-mono leading-tight\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"text-gray-500\\\">// Setup run once</span>\\n<span class=\\\"text-[#FF6B6B]\\\">void</span> setup() {\\n  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\n<span class=\\\"text-gray-500\\\">// Loop forever</span>\\n<span class=\\\"text-[#FF6B6B]\\\">void</span> loop() {\\n  digitalWrite(13, HIGH);\\n  delay(1000);\\n  digitalWrite(13, LOW);\\n  delay(1000);\\n}</pre>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-1 row-span-1 bg-[#6BCB77] border-4 border-black rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black mb-2 uppercase\\\">Project Task</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold mb-4\\\">Build your first light signal! Assemble the LED circuit and upload the code to make it blink.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white/40 p-4 border-2 border-black rounded-xl\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-2\\\">Reinforcement Exercises:</div>\\n          <ul class=\\\"text-xs flex flex-col gap-2 font-bold\\\">\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Change delay to 500ms. What happens?\\n            </li>\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Add a second LED on Pin 12.\\n            </li>\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Calculate Ohms if Voltage is 5V.\\n            </li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"mt-4 w-full py-3 bg-black text-white font-black uppercase rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors border-b-4 border-gray-600\\\">Finish Chapter 01</button>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-10 border-t-4 border-black bg-white flex items-center justify-center gap-8\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\302\251 2024 RoboDoodle Labs</span>\\n    <div class=\\\"h-4 w-px bg-black\\\"></div>\\n    <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Made with \342\232\241 for Future Engineers</span>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
