ass=\\\"text-gray-500\\\">// Setup run once</span>\\n<span class=\\\"text-[#FF6B6B]\\\">void</span> setup() {\\n  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);\\n}\\n\\n<span class=\\\"text-gray-500\\\">// Loop forever</span>\\n<span class=\\\"text-[#FF6B6B]\\\">void</span> loop() {\\n  digitalWrite(13, HIGH);\\n  delay(1000);\\n  digitalWrite(13, LOW);\\n  delay(1000);\\n}</pre>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"col-span-1 row-span-1 bg-[#6BCB77] border-4 border-black rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black mb-2 uppercase\\\">Project Task</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold mb-4\\\">Build your first light signal! Assemble the LED circuit and upload the code to make it blink.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white/40 p-4 border-2 border-black rounded-xl\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-2\\\">Reinforcement Exercises:</div>\\n          <ul class=\\\"text-xs flex flex-col gap-2 font-bold\\\">\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Change delay to 500ms. What happens?\\n            </li>\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Add a second LED on Pin 12.\\n            </li>\\n            <li class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 border-2 border-black bg-white rounded\\\"></div>\\n              Calculate Ohms if Voltage is 5V.\\n            </li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"mt-4 w-full py-3 bg-black text-white font-black uppercase rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors border-b-4 border-gray-600\\\">Finish Chapter 01</button>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-10 border-t-4 border-black bg-white flex items-center justify-