ity. I\'ve decided on the theme and added comments for each line to improve readability.\n\n\n**Adding Terminal Output**\n\nI\'m now focusing on displaying the terminal output, ensuring that it\'s dynamic and responsive. I\'ve successfully implemented a mechanism to update the terminal output area dynamically based on simulated build events. I\'m leveraging React state to manage and display console messages. I am ensuring that any simulated activity is appropriately reflected in the terminal.\n\n\n"
